    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gohery Properties are delighted to bring to the market this impressive four-bedroom spacious detached family residence located in the heart of Galway city. This property is a short walk to the city centre and is located at the entrance to the ever-popular Riverside estate.\r\n30 Glenenail Drive in Riverside is a very comfortable family home located overlooking a beautiful mature spacious garden to the elevation and a large tar and chipped yard to the rear – the potential for further development either as a single dwelling or for multiple dwellings is clear to see and should not be underestimated. The site area is just under 0.23 acre.\r\nThe accommodation in the dwelling is bright and airy - well apportioned rooms for living, dining with a functional kitchen to the rear. The large utility / ground floor bathroom (with wet floor shower) and garage complete the ground floor accommodation.\r\nThere are 4 well proportioned bedrooms to he first floor with main bathroom.\r\nThe property represents a fantastic opportunity to acquire not just a home but an investment for future times where a second dwelling or greater development will be permitted."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "⭐ 4-bedroom property situated on large city centre site\r\n⭐ OIL heating system\r\n⭐ Extends to 140.1 sq mts (1,508sq.ft.) accommodation\r\n⭐Beautifully finished mature front garden\r\n⭐ Large rear yard\r\n⭐ \r\n⭐ \r\n⭐ \r\n⭐ Located on Tuam road in the heart of Galway city & close to all amenities\r\n⭐ Within easy walking distance of Galway City centre"
      },
      {
